rules/cp_v3/data/weapons_table.md
rules/red/data/playbook_opera.txt
rules/cpr_easy/docs/
archive/

# ── 给 Agent 看的说明文档（不是项目本体）────────────────────
Agent/
resources/
/MANIFEST.json
/SCAN_REPORT.json
/SOURCE_INTEGRITY.json
/TEST_RESULTS.md

# ── 系统文件 ────────────────────────────────────────────────
